  keyRisks:["High gold prices cut grams sold (WGC sees 2026 demand at a six-year low)", "Import-duty changes create inventory gains or losses", "Thin margins at regional chains (Thangamayil) when gold swings", "Lab-grown diamonds deflating natural-diamond pricing"],
